~ day_start
Mum: We're nearly there! Just one more day to go.
Kid: Yay! This has been fun, but I'm excited to see Grandma.
Mum: Me too. How's your racing game going?
Kid: Pretty good, but it's harder to play by the ocean! Bird poo keeps getting on the window — YUCK!


do game.begin_game()

=> END


~ day_end
Mum: Oh look, the sun is out!
Kid: ... are we there yet?
Mum: Yes we are!
Kid: Yay! Finally!

do game.end_day()

=> END